@startuml SEQ_15_MELIHAT_DAFTAR_KEGIATAN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-15: Melihat Daftar Kegiatan (View-Only)

actor       "Dosen / Kadep"      as Actor
boundary    "Browser"            as Browser
control     "KegiatanController" as Controller
entity      "Kegiatan Model"     as Model
database    "kegiatan"           as DB

== Melihat Daftar Kegiatan ==

Actor   -> Browser     : Buka menu Kegiatan
Browser -> Controller  : GET /kegiatan
Controller -> Model    : Query semua kegiatan
Model -> DB            : SELECT kegiatan
DB      --> Model      : Data kegiatan
Model --> Controller   : Data kegiatan
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman kegiatan (view-only)
Browser --> Actor      : Daftar kegiatan + tombol "Lihat Detail" saja

== Melihat Detail Kegiatan ==

Actor   -> Browser     : Klik "Lihat Detail" pada salah satu kegiatan
Browser -> Controller  : GET /kegiatan/{id}
Controller -> Model    : Query detail kegiatan
Model -> DB            : SELECT kegiatan WHERE id = {id}
DB      --> Model      : Data kegiatan
Model --> Controller   : Data kegiatan
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman detail kegiatan (view-only)
Browser --> Actor      : Detail kegiatan: tanggal, lokasi, deskripsi, peserta, dokumentasi, status

@enduml
